url: "[DATASET REPOSITORY URL TO FILL IN]"
abstract: >-
  An anonymized benchmark of successful Google Workspace login events,
  labeled as suspicious or not by Google's own operational signal
  (is_suspicious), combining data from two higher-education institutions.
  73,528 events, 36,691 pseudonymized users, spanning December 2025 to
  August 2026. Includes 38 engineered behavioral, temporal, and
  geographic features plus an empirically-validated risk score. The
  is_suspicious label is an operational signal, not a forensic
  confirmation of phishing, credential stuffing, brute force, or actual
  account compromise.
keywords:
  - cloud security
  - identity security
